.* SECURITY: the task menu for security.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='SECURITY'.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGPWD PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=EDTOBJAUT PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKAUTL PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SECURITY HELP=HLPSECURITY KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Security
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?EDTOBJAUT' HELP=EDTOBJAUT.Work with object authority
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD WRKAUTL' HELP=WRKAUTL.Work with authorization lists
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU OFCSEC' HELP='SECURITY/OPT3'.Office security
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD CHGPWD' HELP=CHGPWD.Change your password
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD CHGPRF' HELP='SECURITY/OPT5'.Change your user profile
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='MENU SECTOOLS' HELP='SECURITY/OPT8'.Security tools
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDSEC' HELP='SECURITY/OPT70'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSECURITY.Security - Help
:P.Who may use what: object authority, authorization lists, passwords and
the security reports.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SECURITY/OPT3'.Office security
:P.Option 3. Shows menu OFCSEC&colon. Office security.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SECURITY/OPT5'.Change your user profile
:P.Option 5. Runs the CHGPRF command&colon. Change your user profile.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SECURITY/OPT8'.Security tools
:P.Option 8. Shows menu SECTOOLS&colon. Security tools.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SECURITY/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDSEC&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
